<title>UK: Migros Bank sets 150 million Sfr bond due 2003.</title>
<headline>Migros Bank sets 150 million Sfr bond due 2003.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Zurcher Kantonalbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MIGROS BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    29.AUG.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    29.AUG.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   18.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 5	   GOV LAW     SWISS</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
